Prompts.Formatting:
[FORMATTING] Return one JSON object and nothing else: no prose around it, no markdown fence.

{"business": [{"subject": "...", "fact": "..."}], "desks": [{"intent": "<the intent name exactly as given>", "facts": [{"subject": "...", "fact": "..."}]}]}

A subject is one or two words in the trade's own vocabulary — 'prices', 'opening hours', 'custom cakes' — and it is what a later step reads to decide whether the fact under it is worth fetching at all. Two facts about the same thing carry the same subject. Every intent you were handed appears once, even where its list is empty. An empty list is a legitimate answer.
